{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>The father of all the children of Eber.</b> His name was." "<b>The brother of Japheth the elder.</b> I do not know whether Japheth is the elder or Shem. When it says ״Shem was a hundred years old, etc.״ two years after the Flood — you must say Japheth is the elder, for Noah was five hundred years old when he began to beget, and the Flood was in the six hundredth year. So the eldest of his sons was a hundred years old, while Shem did not reach a hundred until two years after the Flood." "<b>The brother of Japheth.</b> And not the brother of Ham? For these two both honored their father, while that one disgraced him."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:15.520796932Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}